  "longBusinessSummary": "AHT Syngas Technology N.V. designs and installs biomass power plants worldwide. The company's plants convert waste materials into energy carriers, gas into fuels, and fuels into energy. It provides processing of residual materials; hydrochar production; generation of synthesis gas and process heat; gas conditioning; electricity, heat, and cooling generation; and extraction of valuable materials services. The company also offers project process services, including pre-planning, overall project cost and offer, detailed planning, manufacturing and pre-installation, delivery, on-site assembly, and handover of the plant; and maintenance contract services; and basic and detailed engineering services. Further, it operates and provides energy. The company was formerly known as Squeezy Sports Nutrition N.V. and changed its name to AHT Syngas Technology N.V. in May 2014. AHT Syngas Technology N.V. was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Bonn, Germany.",
